  "question": {
    "text": "Work out the heat change (cal) when $40 \\mathrm{~g}$ of He gas at $27^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ undergoes isothermal and reversible compression from initial pressure of $1 \\mathrm{~atm}$ to $10 \\mathrm{~atm}\\left(\\mathrm{R}=2 \\mathrm{cal} \\mathrm{K}^{-1} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}\\right)$.",
