  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} \\mathrm{q} &=-\\mathrm{w}_{\\mathrm{rev}}=-\\left(-2.303 \\mathrm{nRT} \\log \\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{1}}{\\mathrm{P}_{2}}\\right) \\\\ &=2.303 \\times \\frac{40}{4} \\times 2 \\times 300 \\log \\frac{1}{10}=-13.82 \\mathrm{kcal} \\end{aligned}$",
